    {
      "text": "[58:7]  Do you not realize that God knows everything in the heavens and the earth? No three people can meet in secrecy without Him being the fourth, nor five without Him being the sixth, nor less than this, nor more, without Him being there. Then, on the Day of Resurrection, He will inform them of everything they did. God is fully aware of all things.",
      "start": 49.83,
      "end": 70.73,
      "speaker": "Robert",
