          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And in the next verse, the verse says \"if you cannot find a slave\", so, if you don't have a slave of your own,",
      "start": 839.62,
      "end": 845.18,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
