          "end": 1706.22,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " convinced.",
          "start": 1706.22,
          "end": 1706.52,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, it's a blessing.",
