          "end": 1708.36,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " blessing.",
          "start": 1708.36,
          "end": 1708.86,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, I appreciate the fact that this verse deals specifically with disobedience to the messenger.",
