          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Ok. Now, I say \"La Elaha Ella Allah.\"  The Catholic Church says \"Praise Mary, Mother of God.\"",
      "start": 2706.84,
      "end": 2711.67,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
