          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "As you go back \"in God, the believers shall trust.\"",
      "start": 3041.5,
      "end": 3046.48,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
