          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " trust.\"",
          "start": 3044.4,
          "end": 3046.48,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "That says it all right there.",
