          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " there.",
          "start": 3047.78,
          "end": 3048.38,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And you have to put God above everything else, regardless of who it is.",
