        },
        {
          "word": " proofs.",
          "start": 3443.78,
          "end": 3444.38,
          "speaker": "Keikhosrow Emami"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "\"You just give me one simple reason\", and not for a second, you know, backed off, didn't back off, even though I was expecting it.",
